"entity": {
"name": "Fomento de Construcciones y Contratas, S.A.",
"description": "Fomento de Construcciones y Contratas SA is engaged in providing infrastructure construction, project management, and concessionary services. It operates through the following segments: Environmental Services, Integrated Water Management, Construction, Cement, Concessions, and Corporate. The Environmental Services segment offers industrial waste treatment including both the construction and operation of treatment plants, and the energy recovery of waste. The Integrated Water Management segment includes collection, purification and distribution of water for human consumption; sewage collection, filtration and purification; design, construction, operation and maintenance of water infrastructure for municipal, industrial, agricultural services, and others. The Construction segment builds motorways, dual carriageways, roads, tunnels, bridges, ports, airports, hydraulic works, and residential properties. The Cement segment consists of quarries and mineral deposits operations and production of cement, lime, plaster, and concrete. The Concessions segment is involved in concession agreements related to the operation of highways, tunnels and other similar infrastructures. The Corporate segment includes the firm's cash management and administrative activities. The company was founded in 1900 and is headquartered in Barcelona, Spain.",
"rbics_econ": "Business Services",
